# 二进制资源：禁止 git 做换行转换（core.autocrlf=true 会破坏含 0x0A 的原始像素数据）。
# / Binary assets: never let git rewrite line endings (core.autocrlf=true would corrupt
# raw pixel data containing 0x0A bytes).
*.rgba binary
*.OTF binary

# C# 源文件统一用 CRLF 存库，避免每次提交都出现 “LF will be replaced by CRLF” 警告。
# / Store C# sources with CRLF so the “LF will be replaced by CRLF” warning stops appearing
# on every commit.
*.cs text eol=crlf
